abstract: "A siting model and interactive map for secure bike parking (Locky Dock stations) on the University of Auckland's City, Grafton and Newmarket campuses, part of SPAN (Spending Priorities for Active Networks): cyclist approach flows over SPAN's traffic-stress network, eight site indicators from Overture/OpenStreetMap and LINZ LiDAR, and an exact k-dock coverage optimisation."
